28:41.520 --> 28:43.450
awak ada banyak pendapat sendiri.

28:44.610 --> 28:45.930
Nasib awak terletak pada

28:45.930 --> 28:47.200
tangan awak sendiri.

28:48.240 --> 28:49.840
Nenek takkan campur tangan.

28:50.810 --> 28:52.240
Namun, awak kena ingat,

28:53.280 --> 28:54.930
nenek cuma berharap

28:55.610 --> 28:57.270
